config PACKAGE_pkcs11-test
	bool "pkcs11-test - Simple PKCS#11 testing utility"
	default n
	help
	  A lightweight utility for testing PKCS#11 modules.
	  
	  This is a minimal alternative to pkcs11-tool from OpenSC,
	  designed for basic PKCS#11 module testing without heavy
	  dependencies. Perfect for embedded systems.
	  
	  Features:
	  - Load and test PKCS#11 modules
	  - Display module information
	  - Test init/finalize functions
	  - Very small footprint (~10KB)
	  
	  Use this to quickly test libtropic-pkcs11 or any other
	  PKCS#11 module without installing full OpenSC.
	  
	  For full PKCS#11 functionality, use opensc package instead.